    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asili Forest is a captivating 2D platformer that immerses you in a world where nature and technology collide. Developed by Jean Lue of EMILYGOLD LIMITED, this solo project is set to launch in July 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944200/extras/a6dbae2858aa62b674e64bfcd6949fd2.avif?t=1755356511\" width=230 height=86 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of V12, a courageous hero equipped with an advanced, Ironman-like suit. Journey through lush forests, mysterious underground passages, and mechanized landscapes in your quest to rescue your father.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with an arsenal of rockets, bullets, and drones, V12 must battle against hordes of robotic adversaries that threaten the balance between nature and technology.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:  <br>Dynamic Environments: Traverse a richly detailed world where every element, from water to foliage, can be interacted with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Combat: Utilize a diverse array of weapons and abilities to outsmart and outmaneuver formidable foes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asili Forest is a captivating 2D platformer that immerses you in a world where nature and technology collide. Developed by Jean Lue of EMILYGOLD LIMITED, this solo project is set to launch in July 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944200/extras/a6dbae2858aa62b674e64bfcd6949fd2.avif?t=1755356511\" width=230 height=86 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of V12, a courageous hero equipped with an advanced, Ironman-like suit. Journey through lush forests, mysterious underground passages, and mechanized landscapes in your quest to rescue your father.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with an arsenal of rockets, bullets, and drones, V12 must battle against hordes of robotic adversaries that threaten the balance between nature and technology.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:  <br>Dynamic Environments: Traverse a richly detailed world where every element, from water to foliage, can be interacted with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Combat: Utilize a diverse array of weapons and abilities to outsmart and outmaneuver formidable foes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
